description: Keep agent work to the files and schema the task actually needs.
alwaysApply: true
---

# Scope

- Read only the files this task needs. Do not scan the whole repository, old transcripts, or pages you are not changing.
- When the task names a file or page, start there. Open another file only to check a type, import, or query you are about to change.
- Read the database schema, generated types, or Supabase queries when the task links or writes data. Skip that read for copy, layout, and styling changes.
- Do not change the schema, migrations, RLS, or color values in `src/app/globals.css` unless the task asks for that.
- Do not read or commit `.env.local` or any secret.
- Do not open a browser or sign in to test unless the task asks you to.
- Do not add a page, module, or dependency for a change that fits the files already open.
- Leave unrelated dirty files alone.